159
00:07:00,014 --> 00:07:01,048
Eat this.

160
00:07:01,017 --> 00:07:04,038
... I worked hard to make it.

161
00:07:03,049 --> 00:07:04,097
Have mine, too.

162
00:07:04,050 --> 00:07:08,071
…

163
00:07:05,075 --> 00:07:07,083
You have such nice hair.

164
00:07:07,083 --> 00:07:11,031
Hey, do you think my child's cute?

165
00:07:08,084 --> 00:07:12,018
...

166
00:07:11,031 --> 00:07:13,016
Huh? Sure.

167
00:07:12,030 --> 00:07:13,093
… …

168
00:07:13,016 --> 00:07:16,003
Great! Then marry me!

169
00:07:14,005 --> 00:07:17,010
…

170
00:07:18,010 --> 00:07:23,052
（）

171
00:07:22,063 --> 00:07:28,003
If you'd like to talk to this boy, pay two silver coins and stand in line.

172
00:07:23,065 --> 00:07:25,061
...

173
00:07:25,073 --> 00:07:28,094
２

174
00:07:28,003 --> 00:07:29,085
Only for the first hundred people!

175
00:07:29,007 --> 00:07:32,082
100 Be quick!

176
00:07:32,034 --> 00:07:34,024
Hey, you brats!

177
00:07:33,036 --> 00:07:35,012
...

178
00:07:34,024 --> 00:07:36,056
What gives you the right to all the business?!

179
00:07:35,024 --> 00:07:37,045
...

180
00:07:37,058 --> 00:07:39,058
…

181
00:07:41,019 --> 00:07:43,069
Tonari found him.

182
00:07:42,004 --> 00:07:44,063
...

183
00:07:43,069 --> 00:07:45,069
So he's Tonari's.

184
00:07:44,075 --> 00:07:46,059
...

185
00:07:45,069 --> 00:07:49,019
Defy her, and I'll use a deadly poison next time.

186
00:07:46,071 --> 00:07:50,009
...

187
00:07:49,019 --> 00:07:51,083
Okay, say your names, one at a time.

188
00:07:50,021 --> 00:07:52,072
１

189
00:07:53,075 --> 00:07:55,074
What are you guys doing?

190
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:56,064
...

191
00:07:55,074 --> 00:07:58,040
Everyone wants to get close to you.

192
00:07:56,076 --> 00:07:59,031
...

193
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:01,066
You're the most likely candidate to become the island chief, after all.

194
00:07:59,043 --> 00:08:02,056
...

195
00:08:01,066 --> 00:08:05,058
Everyone wants their wishes granted when you win the tournament.

196
00:08:02,069 --> 00:08:06,077
...

197
00:08:05,089 --> 00:08:08,047
Like leaving the island, for example.

198
00:08:06,090 --> 00:08:09,069
...

199
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:14,031
Up until now, none of the village chiefs lasted more than two weeks before being killed. ...

200
00:08:12,015 --> 00:08:15,020
２

201
